# ---- Project Compass generated output -----------------------------------------
# Both paths below are *generated*, never hand-edited:
#
#   .project-compass/       per-machine derived state: scan snapshot, IR, parse
#                           cache, search index, run state, QA log. Fully
#                           rebuildable, and it embeds the absolute project root
#                           (i.e. your local filesystem layout).
#   docs/project-compass/   the six human-facing artifacts this plugin writes
#                           into whatever project it analyses.
#
# This repository ignores its own output on purpose: generated reports go stale
# the moment the code changes, weigh ~0.5 MB, and are trivially reproducible.
# Regenerate them any time with:
#
#   node scripts/compass-cli.mjs analyze . && node scripts/compass-cli.mjs report .
#
# Users who *want* to version the reports of their own project can simply drop
# the second line below (or run the plugin with a different `outputDir`).
.project-compass/
docs/project-compass/

